    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Eventos de seguridad por tipo",
      "description": "Vista maestra: los 11 eventos de seguridad que emite la aplicacion. `auth.login.succeeded` y `auth.login.failed` son los unicos en `info`; el resto se emite en `warn`. `security.cors.denied` aparece aqui aunque no sea de autenticacion ni de autorizacion: es la frontera de configuracion. A diferencia de otros paneles, este no usa `| json` porque `event` si es structured metadata.",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 70,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "hideFrom": { "legend": false, "tooltip": false, "viz": false },
            "insertNulls": false,
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 0,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": { "type": "linear" },
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": { "group": "A", "mode": "normal" },
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "off" }
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": ["sum"],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": { "hideZeros": false, "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "queryType": "range",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true,
          "legendFormat": "{{event}}",
          "expr": "sum by (event) (count_over_time({service=\"sipeg-utp-backend\", environment=~\"$environment\", log_type=\"security\"} [$__auto]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Logins: exitosos vs fallidos",
      "description": "Es la serie que consulta la alerta `> 20 fallos de autenticacion en 5 min` de T10.4, expuesta para calibrar el umbral contra una linea base real. Un orden de magnitud mas de rojos que de verdes es la senal de fuerza bruta; tener mas verdes que rojos es normal en uso diario.",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 4 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 70,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "hideFrom": { "legend": false, "tooltip": false, "viz": false },
            "insertNulls": false,
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 0,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": { "type": "linear" },
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": { "group": "A", "mode": "normal" },
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "off" }
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "auth.login.failed" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "red", "mode": "fixed" } },
              { "id": "custom.lineWidth", "value": 1 }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "auth.login.succeeded" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "green", "mode": "fixed" } },
              { "id": "custom.lineWidth", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": ["sum", "max"],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": { "hideZeros": false, "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "queryType": "range",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true,
          "legendFormat": "auth.login.succeeded",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({service=\"sipeg-utp-backend\", environment=~\"$environment\", log_type=\"security\"} | event=\"auth.login.succeeded\" [$__auto]))"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
